      "text": "An eMudhra CA private key was the number 4. A P-384 key should be a random 384-bit number. To find this one, compute 1\u00d7G, 2\u00d7G, 3\u00d7G and stop when it matches the public key. All eight affected keys were under 256, so that is at most 255 tries.",
