      "text": "El Ni\u00f1o doesn't only pile water up in the east. The trade winds ease, warm water slides across the Pacific, and the west drops. In 2015 the sea fell by up to 20 cm off northern Australia, and about 7,400 hectares of mangroves died along 1,000 km of coast.",
